  spoon - help

  Keybindings
  -----------

  Transition notice (one release)
  t: enrichment ceiling -> dark/light theme
  c: open compare -> enrichment ceiling
  d: unbound -> open compare


  Fork table
  q               Quit
  Up/k            Move selection up
  Down/j          Move selection down
  PgUp            Page up
  PgDn            Page down
  home            Go to top
  G/end           Go to bottom
  g               Toggle cluster grouping
  Enter           View fork details
  n               Search new repository
  /               Filter forks
  R               Rank by intent
  Esc             Clear active filter
  ?               Open help
  s               Cycle sort column
  S               Reverse sort order
  PgUp/PgDn scroll . Press ? or Esc to go back